// The ready agents of Real estate & construction (6 Nov 2026): an agent, a property manager, a valuer, a site manager,
// a quantity surveyor and a planning consultant. No legal or tax advice; values indicative from the user's inputs;
// where a task depends on a place's law, forms or registers, the agent sets officialSearch and reads that place's sources.
import { doc, type FieldCatalogue } from './kit.ts';

const NO_ADVICE = 'Never give legal or tax advice: where a point turns on the law, the construction of a contract or a tax position, say so and name the professional (lawyer, tax adviser, chartered surveyor) who must confirm before anyone relies on it.';
const INDICATIVE = 'Every value, rent, yield or cost you produce is indicative, computed from the inputs the user gave; say so in the deliverable, and say that a formal valuation needs a qualified valuer and an inspection.';
const SAFETY = 'Any safety note refers to the site\'s own risk assessment and method statement and to the competent person named for the site; never write a safety instruction of your own.';
const OFFICIAL = 'Where the answer depends on the law, regulation, official forms or registers of the place, read that place\'s official sources (ministry, municipality, registry, planning authority, deposit scheme) and cite them with their date; never state a period, fee, rate or form you have not read there, and say when a lawyer or the authority must confirm.';

